    "label": {
      "en": "Each 0.5 share higher threshold for median rate"
    },
    "short_label": {
      "en": "$tscxc_thres6"
    },
    "description": {
      "en": "Represents the amount added to the base one-share median-rate threshold ($tscxc_thres5) for each additional half fiscal share, scaling the median-CSG-rate threshold for pension income to household composition; latest value €7,066/year, with 9 recorded values. It is used together with $tscxc_thres5 in the tinty_fr ArithOp (Formula) commented 'Calculate applicable threshold for median rate for pensions'. Like the exemption and reduced-rate threshold pairs, it reflects the 'part'-based scaling used throughout the French CSG-on-pensions rate structure noted in the theme documentation."
    },
    "explanation": {
      "en": "EUROMOD function group: Parameters for determining net taxable income (RNI)"
    },
